  7ce8f3588 Leaseholder make-room variant: recompute a realtime request's short load
  43e3f5a48 Leaseholder make-room variant: hold prefill from a call's announced turn
  27a501075 Leaseholder make-room variant: log the turns announced
  95e8f4617 Leaseholder make-room variant: keep the log line as it was without hints

